  "reason": "Existing evidence is sparse: only config_001, an RNA-only singleprofile PCA baseline, has been tested, with moderate validation accuracy 0.485 and F1 0.464. This leaves major uncertainty about whether image features provide useful signal. config_010 tests an image-only singleprofile ResNet50 baseline, isolating the image representation without adding aggregation or fusion. This is the best next experiment because it establishes a necessary unimodal image reference, reducing uncertainty about modality before investing in more complex multimodal or multiprofile configurations."
